  "introText": "Hey guys! I’m BUDDY! Today, we’ll work on two diphthongs that keep collapsing even at a high level. They’re... …NOW and NO! The glide is where fluent speakers cut corners: profound\n\nA diphthong needs the full movement. Cutting it short flattens the word. Flattened, the two collapse, and now starts to sound exactly like no.",
